                                "sense_id": "6e11c156-5a07-392c-a183-13422cd18b76",
                                "text": "In New York City alone, there are nearly three dozen of these \"nemo\" points from which speeches, music, and entertainment are broadcast regularly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d794d95-173c-4c4a-b12c-ad6170b1eb27",
                                "sense_id": "6e11c156-5a07-392c-a183-13422cd18b76",
                                "text": "All \"nemo\" broadcasting, except entirely musical, would be abandoned. Stations would not risk broadcasting anything arising outside the studio, as there would be no editorial or censorship power."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
